OL,3,GNEWSA'Disappointment' as Turbo Island
OL,4,Avillage green rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group which has been
OL,7,Ffighting for a small patch of land in
OL,8,FBristol to be named a village green
OL,9,Fsays it is disappointing that the bid
OL,10,Fhas been rejected.
OL,12,FThe People's Republic of Stokes Croft
OL,13,F(PRSC) had applied to Bristol City
OL,14,FCouncil to protect Turbo Island in
OL,15,FStokes Croft, which is known for its
OL,16,Fsocial gatherings as well as
OL,17,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
