OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1790942152
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Disappointment' as Turbo Island
OL,4,Avillage green rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors rejected the bid at a
OL,7,Fpublic rights of way and greens
OL,8,Fcommittee meeting earlier, after
OL,9,Finspectors said there was a lack of
OL,10,Fevidence that the site qualified for
OL,11,Fthe status.
OL,13,FNigel Mintz, from Out of Hand, which
OL,14,Fowns the land, said the firm did not
OL,15,Fintend to build on the land but was
OL,16,Fconcerned about fires being lit there.
